        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Swift Bundler offers a range of different bundlers tailored for different",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "platforms and distribution scenarios.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "All of our bundlers are usable without any platform-specific configuration, but",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "many of them have dedicated configuration options for tuning bundler-specific",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "behaviour.",
              "type" : "text"
